OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785746890
OL,3,CWoman guilty of historical sexual
OL,4,Cabuse against boy
OL,6,FA 53-year-old woman has been found
OL,7,Fguilty of historical sexual offences
OL,8,Fagainst an underage boy.
OL,10,FDonna Marie Bentley was unanimously
OL,11,Fconvicted at Jersey's Royal Court on
OL,12,Ftwo counts of procuring an act of
OL,13,Fgross indecency and one count of
OL,14,Findecent assault.
OL,16,FShe was cleared of a further three
OL,17,Fcharges.
OL,19,FThe offences happened during the 1990s
OL,20,Fwhen the victim was too young to
OL,21,Flegally consent to sexual activity.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
