FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785746890
OL,3,CWoman guilty of historical sexual
OL,4,Cabuse against boy
OL,6,FDuring the four-day trial, the victim
OL,7,Ftold the court that Bentley had come
OL,8,Finto his bedroom uninvited while he
OL,9,Fwas sleeping and had sex with him when
OL,10,Fhe was aged 14.
OL,12,FThe States of Jersey Police said
OL,13,FBentley, who was known to her victim,
OL,14,Fsubjected him to sexual abuse.
OL,16,FShe showed little emotion as the jury
OL,17,Fgave their verdict and she has been
OL,18,Fremanded in custody.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785746890
OL,3,CWoman guilty of historical sexual
OL,4,Cabuse against boy
OL,6,FDeputy Bailiff Mark Temple, presiding,
OL,7,Fsaid her application for bail was
OL,8,Fdenied due to the seriousness of the
OL,9,Foffences.
OL,11,FIt took the jury of eight women and
OL,12,Ffour men seven and a half hours to
OL,13,Fdeliberate before they delivered their
OL,14,Fverdicts.
OL,16,FBentley was a registered care manager
OL,17,Fin Jersey, who resigned after she was
OL,18,Fcharged with the offences that were
OL,19,Fnot related to her employment.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
