FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785746890
OL,3,CWoman guilty of historical sexual
OL,4,Cabuse against boy
OL,6,FDetective Constable Elianne Jones, who
OL,7,Fled the police investigation, said:
OL,8,F"The long-lasting trauma sustained
OL,9,Ffrom this abuse has greatly impacted
OL,10,Fthe victim's life and it has taken
OL,11,Fimmense courage to speak out about
OL,12,Fwhat he experienced.
OL,14,F"The States of Jersey Police remain
OL,15,Fcommitted to investigating allegations
OL,16,Fof sexual offending, no matter how
OL,17,Fmuch time has passed since the
OL,18,Foffences occurred.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,355,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785746890
OL,3,CWoman guilty of historical sexual
OL,4,Cabuse against boy
OL,6,F"We would encourage anyone who has
OL,7,Fexperienced sexual abuse, whether
OL,8,Frecently or many years ago, to come
OL,9,Fforward."
OL,11,FThe incident was reported to the force
OL,12,Fin 2024 and, following an
OL,13,Finvestigation, Bentley was charged in
OL,14,FOctober 2025.
OL,16,FA sentencing date will be set on
OL,17,FFriday 14 August 2026.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/5
